        "A natural photograph of the person shown in the reference images, seated at a wooden cafe table beside a large window. The person wears a blue linen shirt and holds a white coffee cup with both hands. The composition is a waist-up three-quarter view with the hands and cup clearly visible. Warm window light falls across the face and shirt, with softly blurred chairs, hanging lamps and other tables in the background. Skin has natural texture, and facial features and markings follow the reference person."
